5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We should prioritize stability. I want to see what external factors have disrupted us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to make sure everyone can actually get to the library! Let's look at access.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I am concerned about the long-term sustainability of our funding structures.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,Why guess when we have history? I want to see what we've actually tried before.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I just hope we don't overwork the staff. I'll look into the training.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, access is important, but only if the service is reliable once they arrive.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"That's true! But if they can't reach us, the reliability doesn't matter, right?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,We must ensure the money lasts. A large sum is useless if it vanishes too quickly.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"Exactly, George. But spending money on things that failed six years ago is the real waste.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should check if we have the right people for the jobs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will focus on the logistics and the environmental constraints we face.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm going to check the bus links and the road closures! I want everyone included.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will examine the grant terms and the equipment lines to see where the leak is.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm sticking to the archives. Let's see those old programs and the outreach sheets.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look at the volunteer register and the room bookings... maybe.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. Let's gather the data before we commit to a proposal.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Yay! I can't wait to see what we find! Let's make this great for everyone!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,Let us proceed. I prefer to see the hard numbers before discussing the options.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"Don't be so boring, George! But yes, let's see who's actually doing their homework.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay... I'll do my best to help.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
