35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,It seems our reliance on external contractors and weather-dependent routes is a significant vulnerability.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Oh no! The people in the outer wards are really struggling to get to us!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,As I suspected. The funding is fragmented. We have money in the wrong buckets.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"Funny how the ""new"" ideas we're discussing are just ghosts of things we did six years ago.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found out... we have volunteers, but the staff aren't trained to manage them.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, if the funding is fragmented, we cannot rely on services that require high, consistent maintenance.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, but we can't just ignore the people who can't reach us! We have to go to them!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,Going to them requires vehicles. And our running lines are already over budget.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"We already did the ""going to them"" part. The outreach sheets show it worked brilliantly.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,If we go to them... who will manage the staff on the road? We're already so tired.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,We need a proposal that is self-contained. No third-party delivery windows or road-dependent schedules.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,But the road closures are only in winter! We can't just stop helping people because of snow!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"It is not about the snow, Yumi. It is about the budget collapsing in year two.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,You're all arguing about the future while ignoring the fact that we've already failed at this.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm worried... if we add more, the staff will just... break. We need a simple plan.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,Simplicity and independence are the only ways to ensure the service doesn't collapse again.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I just want to make sure we don't leave anyone behind. That's the most important thing!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,"I will support a plan that aligns with the endowment's structure, not the temporary grants.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,I'll support whatever doesn't involve pretending we're inventing the wheel for the first time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Ryuji. Something simple. Please.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
